WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.833
Mayor Bloom was in trouble.

2
00:00:07.834 --> 00:00:10.747
"Hey, guys," Roxy called to her friends.

3
00:00:10.748 --> 00:00:16.512
"I'm going to . . . um . . . put more Car Wash signs up around town.

4
00:00:16.513 --> 00:00:21.268
We need more customers!"

5
00:00:21.269 --> 00:00:25.097
Roxy ran down the street.

6
00:00:25.098 --> 00:00:29.059
"That's strange," thought Terrell, watching her go.

7
00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:37.983
"Roxy isn't carrying any signs."

8
00:00:37.984 --> 00:00:41.460
Roxy flew over to Police Headquarters Plaza.

9
00:00:41.461 --> 00:00:45.791
There was a big empty spot where the police station had been.

10
00:00:45.792 --> 00:00:49.850
"Rocket Girl!" called Detective Smith, waving from the ground.

11
00:00:49.851 --> 00:00:51.815
Roxy flew down.

12
00:00:51.816 --> 00:00:55.197
"Mayor Bloom is in trouble," she said.

13
00:00:55.198 --> 00:00:58.246
"Oh no!" said Detective Smith.

14
00:00:58.247 --> 00:01:00.894
"And Police Headquarters is gone!"

15
00:01:00.895 --> 00:01:03.409
He started searching his pockets.

16
00:01:03.410 --> 00:01:05.200
Roxy smiled.

17
00:01:05.201 --> 00:01:10.028
"I don't think Police Headquarters is in your pocket, Detective."

18
00:01:10.029 --> 00:01:14.102
"Very funny," said Detective Smith with a frown.

19
00:01:14.103 --> 00:01:18.163
"I'm looking for my cell phone. Ah, here it is.

20
00:01:18.164 --> 00:01:20.659
Look at this picture I took."

21
00:01:20.660 --> 00:01:23.576
Detective Smith handed the phone to Roxy.

22
00:01:23.577 --> 00:01:27.810
She saw a picture of a tall, silver robot.

23
00:01:27.811 --> 00:01:32.159
"I was walking to Police Headquarters," said Detective Smith.

24
00:01:32.160 --> 00:01:34.639
"Suddenly that robot appeared.

25
00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:38.182
It sprayed a blue bubble around Police Headquarters.

26
00:01:38.183 --> 00:01:42.042
Then the bubble floated away with the whole building in it!"

27
00:01:42.043 --> 00:01:44.594
"Whoa," said Roxy.

28
00:01:44.595 --> 00:01:48.139
"This looks like the work of Dr. Odd."

29
00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:50.767
"You're right," said the detective.

30
00:01:50.768 --> 00:01:56.164
"Dr. Odd is the only villain smart enough to invent a robot like this one.

31
00:01:56.165 --> 00:02:01.102
But why did he take Police Headquarters and Mayor Bloom?"

32
00:02:01.103 --> 00:02:03.813
"I know why," said Roxy.

33
00:02:03.814 --> 00:02:11.876
"So the city can't stop Dr. Odd from stealing something else—like a bank."

34
00:02:11.877 --> 00:02:14.495
A shadow moved across the street.

35
00:02:14.496 --> 00:02:16.283
Roxy looked up.

36
00:02:16.284 --> 00:02:19.788
Floating overhead were more blue bubbles!

37
00:02:19.789 --> 00:02:23.046
Roxy shot into the sky.

38
00:02:23.047 --> 00:02:27.741
Using her super vision, Roxy peered into the nearest bubble.

39
00:02:27.742 --> 00:02:32.115
"That's Mayor Bloom's mansion!" said Roxy.

40
00:02:32.116 --> 00:02:34.576
She struck the bubble as hard as she could.

41
00:02:34.577 --> 00:02:41.700
Boing! Roxy bounced and landed far away, in another neighborhood.

42
00:02:41.701 --> 00:02:44.125
"Ow," said Roxy.

43
00:02:44.126 --> 00:02:47.894
Then she saw blue mist and jumped to her feet.

44
00:02:47.895 --> 00:02:52.236
A car skidded around the corner and then bloop!

45
00:02:52.237 --> 00:02:55.164
It was caught in a bubble and floated away.

46
00:02:55.165 --> 00:02:56.678
More bubbles formed.

47
00:02:56.679 --> 00:02:58.862
Bloop! Bloop!

48
00:02:58.863 --> 00:03:03.925
They carried away cars, buses, people, and all sorts of other things.

49
00:03:03.926 --> 00:03:08.598
"Uh-oh," thought Roxy. "I bet Dr. Odd's robot is—"

50
00:03:08.599 --> 00:03:11.617
Crash! Boom!

51
00:03:11.618 --> 00:03:13.286
Roxy looked up.

52
00:03:13.287 --> 00:03:16.547
The robot stomped past her.

53
00:03:16.548 --> 00:03:20.982
It stepped on a car and crushed it.

54
00:03:20.983 --> 00:03:25.740
Roxy shot toward the robot.

55
00:03:25.741 --> 00:03:31.510
But before she could reach it, the robot spun around. Bloop!

56
00:03:31.511 --> 00:03:37.950
Roxy was trapped in a bubble!

